    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>Rollout Phase:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; color:#00B4D8; font-weight:bold;">Phase 1 (Rank #1)</td></tr>
